<title>UK: World Bank sets 250 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 250 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    29.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.925   PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT    REOFFER YIELD 4.85 PCT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	GOV LAW	 GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BENCHMARK 121</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
